c-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>: funneled through bottlenecks.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1479" data-end="1539">
<p data-start="1481" data-end="1539"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span></span></span>: expelled from the system rather than metabolized.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1541" data-end="1794">Thus, where semantic infrastructures preserve obstructions as higher morphisms, chokepoint capitalism erases them—transforming all conversations and artworks into bots whose training corpora are not their living contexts but their imposed chokepoints.</p>
<p data-start="1796" data-end="1809"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">□</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\square</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.675em;"></span><span class="mord amsrm">□</span></span></span></span></p>
