ralization paragraph</strong> that widens the corollary beyond cinema:</p>
<hr data-start="84" data-end="87">
<h3 data-start="89" data-end="109">Generalization</h3>
<p data-start="110" data-end="585">The lesson of generative cinema is not confined to film. The same dynamic governs music, journalism, and even science. A music generator trained on the open corpus of jazz standards behaves like a semantic infrastructure, where unresolved tensions—blue notes, polyrhythms, dissonances—become material for improvisation. But when tuned for streaming platforms, the same generator collapses into a chokepoint bot: engagement-optimized playlists with reduced harmonic variety.</p>
<p data-start="587" data-end="1096">Newsfeeds show the same pattern. A semantic infrastructure would preserve contradictory accounts of events, metabolizing them into deliberation. Platform infrastructures suppress contradiction in favor of click-through and virality, collapsing journalism into recommendation funnels. Even scientific publishing follows this cycle: peer review can act as a sheaf-like mechanism, preserving obstructions as live controversies, while citation metrics and paywalls collapse the field into chokepoint capitalism.</p>
<p data-start="1098" data-end="1335">In each case, the theorem holds: every act of expression is a bot trained on its context. And the corollary follows: when infrastructures erase obstructions, those bots become chokepoint bots, optimized for capture rather than meaning.</p>
<hr data-start="1337" data-end="1340">
<p data-start="1342" data-end="1520" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to now <strong data-start="1367" data-end="1421">thread this back to your RSVP framework explicitly</strong> (Φ, 𝒗, S) so the essay closes the loop between the cultural critique and the formal field theory?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.1650