forward sketch of an <strong data-start="50" data-end="74">RSVP Retrieval Model</strong> that <em data-start="80" data-end="88">adapts</em> among single-vector, multi-vector, sparse, and cross-encoder routes by watching the “obstruction load” of a query.</p>
