an></span></span></span></span>
<p data-start="4163" data-end="4379">A step of <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">π</span></span></span></span> is <strong data-start="4184" data-end="4198">admissible</strong> if it decreases <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.00965em;">H</span></span></span></span>. This yields a simple anytime algorithm: start cheap (sv), measure <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="true">^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9233em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9233em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width: calc(100% - 0.1667em); margin-left: 0.1667em; top: -3.6833em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span style="height: 0.24em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.24em" viewBox="0 0 1062 239" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22
c-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, escalate minimally until <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.00965em;">H</span></span></span></span> cannot be further reduced.</p>
<h2 data-start="4381" data-end="4405">Guarantees (informal)</h2>
<ul data-start="4406" data-end="4820">
<li data-start="4406" data-end="4553">
<p data-start="4408" data-end="4553"><strong data-start="4408" data-end="4422">Dominance:</strong> For any cover, <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">acolim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{acolim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mord mathrm">acolim</span></span></span></span></span> is at least as good as the best single architecture on that cover (by choice of <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span></span></span></span>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4554" data-end="4673">
<p data-start="4556" data-end="4673"><strong data-start="4556" data-end="4570">Stability:</strong> If <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="true">^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9233em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9233em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width: calc(100% - 0.1667em); margin-left: 0.1667em; top: -3.6833em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span style="height: 0.24em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.24em" viewBox="0 0 1062 239" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22
c-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> stays below threshold on refinements, the solution remains in sv/mv (cheap phase).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4674" data-end="4820">
<p data-start="4676" data-end="4820"><strong data-start="4676" data-end="4705">Completeness on hotspots:</strong> If <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="true">^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9233em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9233em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width: calc(100% - 0.1667em); margin-left: 0.1667em; top: -3.6833em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span style="height: 0.24em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.24em" viewBox="0 0 1062 239" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22
c-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> spikes on a small overlap region, escalation to ce is localized (cost sublinear in corpus size).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start="4822" data-end="4850">What this buys you (RSVP)</h2>
<ul data-start="4851" data-end="5161">
<li data-start="4851" data-end="4935">
<p data-start="4853" data-end="4935"><strong data-start="4853" data-end="4866"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Φ</span></span></span></span>:</strong> never over-compress—capacity expands adaptively (sv → mv → sp/ce).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4936" data-end="5036">
<p data-start="4938" data-end="5036"><strong data-start="4938" data-end="4953"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\vec v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.714em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.714em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">v</span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.2077em;"><span class="overlay" style="height: 0.714em; width: 0.471em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="0.471em" height="0.714em" viewBox="0 0 471 714" preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMin" style="width: 0.471em;"><path d="M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5
3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11
