c-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:</strong> flows are recomputed <em data-start="4975" data-end="4989">where needed</em> (local ce) while staying scalable elsewhere.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5037" data-end="5161">
<p data-start="5039" data-end="5161"><strong data-start="5039" data-end="5049"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span></span></span>:</strong> obstructions are <strong data-start="5067" data-end="5079">measured</strong> and <strong data-start="5084" data-end="5099">metabolized</strong>: kept (mv/sp) or explicitly rewoven (ce)—not silently erased.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="5163" data-end="5166">
<h3 data-start="5168" data-end="5214">Minimal implementation recipe (conceptual)</h3>
<ol data-start="5215" data-end="5582">
<li data-start="5215" data-end="5260">
<p data-start="5218" data-end="5260"><strong data-start="5218" data-end="5238">First pass (sv):</strong> retrieve top-<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">K</span></span></span></span>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5261" data-end="5372">
<p data-start="5264" data-end="5372"><strong data-start="5264" data-end="5292">Estimate <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="true">^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9233em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9233em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span><span class="svg-align" style="width: calc(100% - 0.1667em); margin-left: 0.1667em; top: -3.6833em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span style="height: 0.24em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="0.24em" viewBox="0 0 1062 239" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22
c-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z"></path></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:</strong> via low-rank residuals / sign-pattern instability under prompt perturbations.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5373" data-end="5486">
<p data-start="5376" data-end="5486"><strong data-start="5376" data-end="5386">Route:</strong> if low → return; if mid → widen with mv/sp and re-rank; if high → ce on the ambiguous slice only.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5487" data-end="5582">
<p data-start="5490" data-end="5582"><strong data-start="5490" data-end="5499">Glue:</strong> merge lists with a learned coherence scorer (penalize non-monotone refinements).</p>
</li>
